# Rider Pi secrets -- TEMPLATE.
#
# This repo is PUBLIC, so real secret values are NOT committed. To rebuild the Pi:
#   1. cp pi/secrets.env.example pi/secrets.env      (pi/secrets.env is gitignored)
#   2. fill in the value(s) below
#   3. follow docs/PI_HOST_SETUP.md -- it sources this file where a secret is needed
#
# This is the COMPLETE list of secrets reconstruction needs. If it's filled in, nothing
# else about the rebuild requires a value you'd have to remember.

# The nicou 5 GHz WiFi passphrase (WPA2-PSK). Used in PI_HOST_SETUP.md step 5.
NICOU_WIFI_PSK=

# Marc's iPhone Personal Hotspot -- the Rider's field network (no home WiFi). Used in PI_HOST_SETUP.md
# step 5b. The name is the iPhone's name exactly as Settings > General > About > Name shows it
# (an apostrophe there is the curly ’, not ').
PHONE_HOTSPOT_SSID=
PHONE_HOTSPOT_PSK=
